The following changes since commit 982d411c303a475424c67966990b5803cc536319:

  Merge tag 'asoc-3.3' of git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/broonie/sound into for-linus (2012-02-08 21:29:38 +0100)

